    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have a slant towards the divine; whether through your vocation or your tradition you strongly embody philosophy or faith. While in any urban setting, you have a knack for finding a place of worship or study, or at least someone who might be inclined for a certain faith or philosophy (or at least finding people who might know). You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.plBGdZhqq5JBl1D8]{Gather Information} or similar checks to find these places or people, or a +2 circumstance bonus if it is a faith or philosophy you follow.</span></p>"
